---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Premium Inverters | Fronius, Enphase & SMA | Brisbane Solar">
  <main class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <nav class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-600 flex items-center gap-2">
          ← Back to Home
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
          The "Brain" of Your System: Choosing an Inverter
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-12">
          Your panels catch the sun, but your inverter turns it into electricity you can actually use. It is the hardest working part of your system and the most likely to fail if you buy cheap.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-12 mb-16">
          <section class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">String Inverters (The Workhorse)</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
              Best for roofs with no shading. All panels are linked together like a string of Christmas lights. Simple, reliable, and cost-effective.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-orange-500 font-bold">
              <span>Top Pick: Fronius Primo / Symo</span>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Microinverters (The Ultimate Performance)</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
              Each panel has its own small inverter. If one panel gets shaded by a chimney or a tree, the others keep producing at 100%. Offers the best monitoring and safety.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-orange-500 font-bold">
              <span>Top Pick: Enphase IQ8</span>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Hybrid Inverters (Battery Ready)</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
              Designed to manage both your solar panels and a home battery. If you're planning on adding a battery later, a hybrid inverter saves you thousands in future upgrade costs.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-orange-500 font-bold">
              <span>Top Pick: Sungrow SH5.0RS</span>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-orange-400">Why we don't install "Budget" Inverters</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Inverters sit in the heat and switch high-voltage electricity thousands of times a second. Budget brands often fail just after their 5-year warranty expires. We only install brands with a proven 10+ year track record in Australia and local service offices in Brisbane or Sydney.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center bg-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-12 border-2 border-orange-100">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Which one is right for your roof?</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8">We'll analyze your roof's shading profile and recommend the most efficient setup.</p>
          <a href="/#quote" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all">
            Get an Expert Recommendation
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
